cer  Chuck Williams chose to abandon ship to  work on the movie big hero 6 which  proved to be a big success the movie was  officially shelved in 2009 and has yet  to be dusted off and revived although  the movie might have been deemed too  dark for children we can't help but fall  in love with its animation we mean just  look at those elves they're super  adorable wildlife we've kept the best  for last and by best we mean worse  honestly we can't believe that Disney  sought to greenlight this movie seeing  as it was riddled with adult jokes  Wildlife was directed by Howard Baker  and Roger gold it was developed by the  Walt Disney Company  in the late 1990s however it soon got  shelved in 2000 the movie was about a  nightclub owner named red pit sane who  was in dire need of a new star act to  save his club red and kitty start  looking for a brand new act and they  come upon Ella a talking elephant  problem is she has low self-esteem and  is scared to take the stage but all that  changes one night when li gets  electrocuted and awakens to believe  she's a big star the movie seemed like a  whole lot of fun which is why it was  predicted to be a hoot however the  wildlife team embedded some pretty  serious jokes into their film so when  the vice-chairman of the board  Roy Disney viewed the presentation reel  he couldn't believe his ears in fact he  cut the presentation real short claiming  that he was appalled by its sultry humor  so you might be wondering which joke  caused Roy to shut down the product  well apparently Roy's jaw hit the floor  when two characters who were hinted  towards being a part of the LGBTQ  community entered the sewers and said  have you ever been down a manhole before  after hearing this we totally side with  Roy what were the writers thinking we  mean come on that's just ridiculous so  what did you guys think about these  canceled disney movies are there any you  would have liked to see on the big  screen let us know in the comment  section